# 教学资源相关接口测试

### 1. 上传教学资源
POST http://localhost:8083/api/resources/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./test.mp4
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="courseId"

1
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chapterId"

1
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chapterName"

第一章
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

测试视频
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

测试描述
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="createdBy"

1
--boundary--

### 2. 获取教学资源详情
GET http://localhost:8083/api/resources/1

### 3. 获取课程的所有教学资源（按章节分组）
GET http://localhost:8083/api/resources/list/1

### 4. 获取章节的教学资源
GET http://localhost:8083/api/resources/chapter/1/1

### 5. 删除教学资源
DELETE http://localhost:8083/api/resources/1?operatorId=1

### 6. 更新学习进度
POST http://localhost:8083/api/resources/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": 2,
  "studentId": 1,
  "progress": 80,
  "position": 120
}

### 7. 获取学习进度
GET http://localhost:8083/api/resources/progress/1/1

### 8. 获取资源访问URL
GET http://localhost:8083/api/resources/url/1

### 9. 获取课程资源及学习进度信息
POST http://localhost:8083/api/resources/chapter/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "chapterId": 1
}

### 10. 更新资源时长
PUT http://localhost:8083/api/resources/1/duration
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "duration": 3600
}